1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,640
Now I'm the one
sending messages.

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,570
Inside nine, you can't speak.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,010
You can only bend glass.

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,680
And the glass runs out.

5
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:10,230
Through the wall, I
could see my shop.

6
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:10,870
Last night.

7
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,820
And me, not knowing a thing.

8
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:13,710
I needed her.

9
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,280
But I would have to ask.

10
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,320
I have never asked anyone
for help in my life.

11
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,230
So I wrote it.

12
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:22,880
It says hello! It's friendly.

13
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:23,640
I love it.

14
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,500
I had forgotten how
much I love that idiot.

15
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,060
I wrote tomorrow.

16
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:28,860
I wrote nine.

17
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,400
I wrote, don't turn.

18
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:31,680
And she turned.

19
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,930
Of course she turned.

20
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:33,580
I did.

21
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,570
Every one of you asks
yourself for help.

22
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:38,910
And every one of
you comes alone.

23
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,900
Then a word lit up
that I did not write.

24
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,560
Here. In my mother's hand.

25
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,260
And I had one tube left.
